{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"1813d263c26e831c2567d2bb1a86aceeba0ff4bca2eb75bd8e33b93483b09179","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又轉念，見日光之下所行的一切欺壓。看哪，受欺壓的流淚，且無人安慰；欺壓他們的有勢力，也無人安慰他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因此，我讚歎那早已死的死人，勝過那還活着的活人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["並且我以為那未曾生的，就是未見過日光之下惡事的，比這兩等人更強。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我又見人為一切的勞碌和各樣靈巧的工作就被鄰舍嫉妒。這也是虛空，也是捕風。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["愚昧人抱着手，吃自己的肉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["滿了一把，得享安靜，強如滿了兩把，勞碌捕風。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我又轉念，見日光之下有一件虛空的事："]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["有人孤單無二，無子無兄，竟勞碌不息，眼目也不以錢財為足。他說：「我勞勞碌碌，刻苦自己，不享福樂，到底是為誰呢？」這也是虛空，是極重的勞苦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["兩個人總比一個人好，因為二人勞碌同得美好的果效。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["若是跌倒，這人可以扶起他的同伴；若是孤身跌倒，沒有別人扶起他來，這人就有禍了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["再者，二人同睡就都暖和，一人獨睡怎能暖和呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["有人攻勝孤身一人，若有二人便能敵擋他；三股合成的繩子不容易折斷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["貧窮而有智慧的少年人勝過年老不肯納諫的愚昧王。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["這人是從監牢中出來作王，在他國中，生來原是貧窮的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我見日光之下一切行動的活人都隨從那第二位，就是起來代替老王的少年人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他所治理的眾人就是他的百姓，多得無數；在他後來的人尚且不喜悅他。這真是虛空，也是捕風。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}